      "description": "Blended with non-traditional music at Lindy Booty (2004, San Francisco and Sacramento), shaping fusion's development.",
      "inDefinedTermSet": {
        "@id": "https://motleyhue.org/about/#what-is-fusion"
      }
    },
    {
